                        <seg type="script">A second half of the twentieth-century script.</seg>
                        <seg type="ink">Black, red (strong red).</seg>
                        <desc>Mediocre. The scribe’s name, <persName role="scribe" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15551WaldaTensae">Walda Tǝnśāʾe</persName>, is written in the supplication formula on <locus target="#161vb"/>.</desc>
